# Server-side API provider configuration template
# Copy the variables you actually use into your deployment environment.
# These are placeholders, NOT real API keys or ready-to-use endpoints.
# Provider keys must be obtained from each provider. Do not expose secrets via VITE_*.
# Configure only APIs that your app's server-side integration implements.

